{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-36","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-36-talk-403813801-line","text":"无名客的列车停靠布达安尔利站台，后厢上有无穷馈赠。戴着毛毡帽的旅行者靠在车厢前，他衣着破烂，毛靴沾着泥土。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-36-talk-403813802-line","text":"你走近车厢，他朝你招手。「阿基维利曾化身普通人，与布达安尔利人一起开拓冒险，我们交换旅程中的有趣经历。」","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-36-text-18433386777241106097-choice","text":"祝福重铸","speaker":""},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-36-text-13989803470252194998-effect","text":"舍弃1个3星祝福, 并获得1个3星祝福。","speaker":""},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-36-text-327117740231784138-choice","text":"祝福交换","speaker":""}]}
